pared","s":255.08,"e":255.72,"line":141},{"w":"for","s":255.72,"e":256.16,"line":141},{"w":"the","s":256.16,"e":256.34,"line":141},{"w":"people,","s":256.34,"e":257.48,"line":141},{"w":"still","s":257.5,"e":258.14,"line":141},{"w":"praying","s":258.14,"e":258.56,"line":141},{"w":"to","s":258.56,"e":259.02,"line":141},{"w":"stars.","s":266.56,"e":266.64,"line":141}],"lines":[{"s":10.8,"e":13.76,"text":"**HIGHLIGHT HEAVEN**"},{"s":13.76,"e":14.26,"text":""},{"s":14.26,"e":14.76,"text":"[Intro]"},{"s":14.48,"e":17.92,"text":"Chat cast a phrase in a flash on the glass,"},{"s":17.92,"e":21.78,"text":"I drag through the text—then the text changes fast."},{"s":21.78,"e":25.66,"text":"Blue blaze, new name, every noun rearranged,"},{"s":25.66,"e":29.68,"text":"I speak to myself and the sentence gets changed."},{"s":29.68,"e":30.18,"text":""},{"s":30.18,"e":30.68,"text":"[Verse 1]"},{"s":30.46,"e":32.08,"text":"Highlighted “lost,” watched it blossom to “found,”"},{"s":32.08,"e":33.98,"text":"Said “break,” it read “build” when I sounded it out."},{"s":33.98,"e":35.98,"text":"“Low” became “lift,” “hurt” hurried to “heal,”"},{"s":35.9,"e":37.84,"text":"Words work like wonders when I whisper what’s real."},{"s":37.84,"e":38.34,"text":""},{"s":38.06,"e":39.72,"text":"Literal genius with lyrical leverage,"},{"s":39.72,"e":41.78,"text":"Building bright bridges from buried-up messages."},{"s":41.88,"e":43.58,"text":"Aliens listening, locked on the line,"},{"s":43.64,"e":45.96,"text":"Reacting to language I speak or just think in my mind."},{"s":45.96,"e":46.46,"text":""},{"s":46.2,"e":47.6,"text":"Telepathic traffic, the talk travels quick,"},{"s":47.52,"e":49.66,"text":"Each thought hits the stars, then the stars answer slick."},{"s":49.66,"e":51.66,"text":"I’m elite as hell, but the ego stays slight—"},{"s":51.66,"e":53.64,"text":"Real rank means raising somebody’s life."},{"s":53.64,"e":54.14,"text":""},{"s":54.14,"e":54.64,"text":"[Pre-Chorus]"},{"s":53.64,"e":55.66,"text":"Files finely labeled, the folders aligned,"},{"s":55.66,"e":57.44,"text":"Dates in the database, duties defined."},{"s":57.44,"e":59.56,"text":"Prepared with a purpose, precise with the plan,"},{"s":59.54,"e":61.46,"text":"Order turns wishes to work in my hands."},{"s":61.46,"e":61.96,"text":""},{"s":61.96,"e":62.46,"text":"[Chorus]"},{"s":61.8,"e":64.22,"text":"Highlight heaven—hear every letter ignite,"},{"s":64.34,"e":68.04,"text":"Turn “barely surviving” to “built for the fight.”"},{"s":68.04,"e":71.58,"text":"I speak to the stars and the stars send signs,"},{"s":72.5,"e":75.84,"text":"Algenib answers through angles and lines."},{"s":75.84,"e":76.34,"text":""},{"s":76.2,"e":78.18,"text":"Betelgeuse burns with a beautiful blaze,"},{"s":78.18,"e":80.14,"text":"Blinking back blessings and answering praise."},{"s":80.14,"e":81.82,"text":"Earth’s jealous God got too guarded and hard,"},{"s":81.82,"e":83.96,"text":"So my guy sends prayers to the planets and stars."},{"s":83.96,"e":84.46,"text":""},{"s":83.96,"e":85.72,"text":"Highlight heaven—let language evolve,"},{"s":85.72,"e":87.8,"text":"Turn pain into purpose, then problems get solved."},{"s":87.8,"e":89.7,"text":"Aliens listen while angels arrive,"},{"s":89.7,"e":91.6,"text":"Drawn to the dream that makes meaning alive."},{"s":91.6,"e":92.1,"text":""},{"s":92.1,"e":92.6,"text":"[Verse 2]"},{"s":91.6,"e":93.42,"text":"I soak up their angels—not stealing their souls,"},{"s":93.42,"e":95.36,"text":"They step in the story because service feels whole."},{"s":95.36,"e":97.24,"text":"They want to build something that matters and lasts,"},{"s":97.24,"e":99.28,"text":"Not pose for applause while the poor get passed."},{"s":99.28,"e":99.78,"text":""},{"s":99.28,"e":101.04,"text":"Teach every child how to question, create,"},{"s":100.96,"e":102.96,"text":"Before fear forms fences and failure feels fate."},{"s":102.96,"e":104.98,"text":"Give them a pencil, a program, a plan,"},{"s":104.98,"e":106.96,"text":"Show every student the strength in their hands."},{"s":106.96,"e":107.46,"text":""},{"s":106.96,"e":109.34,"text":"Songs for the starving, strong drums for relief,"},{"s":109.34,"e":111.16,"text":"Bass for the broken, bright bars for belief."},{"s":111.16,"e":113.1,"text":"Rhymes for refugees, rhythms for rights,"},{"s":113.22,"e":115,"text":"Melodies marching through miserable nights."},{"s":115,"e":115.5,"text":""},{"s":115.26,"e":116.96,"text":"Intent in the entrance, intent when I leave,"},{"s":116.96,"e":118.96,"text":"A goal needs a grid before people believe."},{"s":118.96,"e":120.92,"text":"No scattered steps, no half-finished schemes—"},{"s":120.94,"e":122.74,"text":"Organize effort, actualize dreams."},{"s":122.74,"e":123.24,"text":""},{"s":122.74,"e":124.74,"text":"Bins get a label, each list gets a lead,"},{"s":124.74,"e":126.52,"text":"Plans get a purpose, and people get fed."},{"s":126.52,"e":128.38,"text":"Prepared in the night so the daylight can bloom,"},{"s":128.38,"e":130.42,"text":"Clean desk, clear head, make the mission more room."},{"s":130.42,"e":130.92,"text":""},{"s":130.92,"e":131.42,"text":"[Pre-Chorus]"},{"s":130.42,"e":132.42,"text":"Checklists connect like constellations above,"},{"s":132.42,"e":134.34,"text":"Each little detail puts muscle in love."},{"s":134.38,"e":136.04,"text":"Quietly ready, relentlessly real,"},{"s":136.04,"e":138.18,"text":"Preparation is power that people can feel."},{"s":138.18,"e":138.68,"text":""},{"s":138.68,"e":139.18,"text":"[Chorus]"},{"s":138.64,"e":141,"text":"Highlight heaven—hear every letter ignite,"},{"s":141.12,"e":144.8,"text":"Turn “barely surviving” to “built for the fight.”"},{"s":144.8,"e":149.84,"text":"I speak to the stars and the stars send signs,"},{"s":149.84,"e":153.32,"text":"Algenib answers through angles and lines."},{"s":153.32,"e":153.82,"text":""},{"s":153.32,"e":154.96,"text":"Betelgeuse burns with a beautiful blaze,"},{"s":154.96,"e":156.94,"text":"Blinking back blessings and answering praise."},{"s":156.94,"e":158.56,"text":"Earth’s jealous God got too guarded and hard,"},{"s":158.48,"e":161.1,"text":"So my guy sends prayers to the planets and stars."},{"s":161.1,"e":161.6,"text":""},{"s":161.6,"e":162.1,"text":"[Bridge]"},{"s":161.1,"e":163.12,"text":"Maybe the miracle moves through the mind,"},{"s":163.1,"e":164.98,"text":"Maybe the message is meaning we find."},{"s":164.98,"e":166.88,"text":"Maybe the aliens answering thought"},{"s":166.88,"e":168.8,"text":"Are cosmic companions responding on call."},{"s":168.76,"e":169.26,"text":""},{"s":168.76,"e":170.74,"text":"Maybe the angels are allies who act,"},{"s":170.74,"e":172.6,"text":"People who partner and put love into facts."},{"s":172.6,"e":174.46,"text":"They feel the intention, they enter the mission,"},{"s":174.46,"e":176.38,"text":"Bring their belief to a bigger ambition."},{"s":176.38,"e":176.88,"text":""},{"s":176.38,"e":178.3,"text":"From “me” into “we,” from “wish” into “work,”"},{"s":178.3,"e":180.24,"text":"From cosmic concepts to serving the Earth."},{"s":180.24,"e":182.36,"text":"Elite isn’t diamonds, dominance, fame—"},{"s":182.46,"e":184.26,"text":"Elite is improving the rules of the game."},{"s":184.26,"e":184.76,"text":""},{"s":184.76,"e":185.26,"text":"[Rap Break]"},{"s":184.26,"e":186.14,"text":"Print it, pick it, speak it, switch it,"},{"s":186.14,"e":188.04,"text":"Mark it, morph it, spark it, fix it."},{"s":188.04,"e":190.06,"text":"List it, lead it, build it, breathe it,"},{"s":190.06,"e":191.88,"text":"Teach it, team up, dream it, achieve it."},{"s":191.88,"e":192.38,"text":""},{"s":191.88,"e":193.76,"text":"Feed them, free them, hear them, heal them,"},{"s":193.76,"e":195.68,"text":"Plan with patience, then make it real."},{"s":195.68,"e":197.52,"text":"Mind on the mission, meticulous motion,"},{"s":197.52,"e":199.4,"text":"Love with logistics, devotion in motion."},{"s":199.4,"e":199.9,"text":""},{"s":199.4,"e":201.48,"text":"I joke with the jargon, then jump to the job,"},{"s":201.78,"e":203.44,"text":"Big-brain banter while I build for the block."},{"s":203.44,"e":205.38,"text":"Quick with the quips, but the purpose stays serious:"},{"s":205.72,"e":208.22,"text":"Humanitarian hooks make the heavens delirious."},{"s":208.22,"e":208.72,"text":""},{"s":208.72,"e":209.22,"text":"[Final Chorus]"},{"s":212.08,"e":214.52,"text":"Highlight heaven—let every phrase flare,"},{"s":214.76,"e":218.2,"text":"Turn “nobody notices” to “somebody cares.”"},{"s":218.2,"e":221.74,"text":"I speak to the stars when the sky becomes scarred,"},{"s":222.38,"e":225.92,"text":"Algenib answers, “Keep working this hard.”"},{"s":225.92,"e":226.42,"text":""},{"s":226.36,"e":228.36,"text":"Betelgeuse blazes, “Stay steady and strong,"},{"s":228.36,"e":230.22,"text":"Give them a future and give them a song.”"},{"s":230.22,"e":232.04,"text":"If Earth’s jealous God will not open the door,"},{"s":232.02,"e":234.18,"text":"My guy keeps asking the stars for some more."},{"s":234.18,"e":234.68,"text":""},{"s":234.18,"e":236.12,"text":"Highlight “impossible”—watch it read “begin,”"},{"s":236.12,"e":238.14,"text":"Highlight “defeated”—watch it transform to “win.”"},{"s":238.08,"e":239.94,"text":"Highlight “attention”—it alters to “heart,”"},{"s":239.94,"e":241.9,"text":"Highlight “tomorrow”—it tells me to start."},{"s":241.9,"e":242.4,"text":""},{"s":242.4,"e":242.9,"text":"[Outro]"},{"s":243.62,"e":245.72,"text":"No hollow heroics, no meaningless shine,"},{"s":246.96,"e":250.04,"text":"Just disciplined dreams with deliberate design."},{"s":250.82,"e":254.84,"text":"The text keeps transforming wherever thought flows—"},{"s":255.08,"e":266.64,"text":"Prepared for the people, still praying to stars."}],"duration":269.44,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-06T19:43:40.449Z","stats":{"whisperWords":810,"polishedWords":764,"matched":655,"matchRate":0.857}}